      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "客户端 vs 服务端耗时",
      "description": "客户端 P95 与服务端实际处理耗时对比。两者差距即链路与排队开销。服务端平均 = rate(_sum)/rate(_count)，因未开 histogram 无法算服务端分位数。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "projectku-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
