    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "服务端分位数：已开启",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 服务端 P95/P99 已可用\n\n历史状态：`/api/actuator/prometheus` 的 `_bucket` 指标为 **0 条**，导致服务端无法计算分位数。\n\n**2026-10-06 已修复并部署验证**：在 `back/src/main/resources/application.yml` 的 `management.metrics` 下增加\n\n```yaml\ndistribution:\n  percentiles-histogram:\n    http.server.requests: true\n```\n\n重新部署到实例 30634 后，`_bucket` 由 0 条变为 **679 条**，`histogram_quantile()` 已生效，见下方「服务端 P95 / P99」面板。\n\n### 已观测到的服务端分位数（2026-10-06 基准）\n\n252 req/s、60 VU、2 分钟：**服务端 P95 = 18.35ms、P99 = 36.62ms、0 失败**。同期连接池峰值仅 2/20，进程 CPU 峰值 24.5%，远未触及瓶颈。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "阈值口径与使用说明",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 41
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 两套阈值口径\n\n| 口径 | P95 | P99 | 失败率 | 适用 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 项目原有 | 800ms | 1500ms | <1% | 服务端容量判定 |\n| 跨公网实测 | 2000ms | 3300ms | — | 本机加压时的端到端观测 |\n\n跨公网压测时延迟由链路主导，不能直接用于服务端容量判定。压测机放到服务器本机后，应使用「项目原有」口径。\n\n### 数据来源\n\n- **客户端指标**（`k6_*`）：k6 通过 remote write 上报，需带 `-o experimental-prometheus-rw` 运行。\n- **服务端指标**：Prometheus 每 5 秒采集 `111.170.33.2:60080/api/actuator/prometheus`。\n\n### 单位\n\n本次核对：k6 的 `k6_http_req_*` 与服务端的 `http_server_requests_seconds_*` **均为秒**，可直接同轴对比。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "服务端 P95 / P99（按 uri，histogram_quantile）",
      "description": "基于直方图 bucket 计算的服务端真实尾延迟，不含网络时间。这是服务端容量判定的权威口径。直方图为累积分布，必须用 rate() 作用于 bucket 再聚合，且 sum by (le) 不能漏掉 le 标签。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "projectku-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 4,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "projectku-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"shang-pivot\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 {{uri}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "projectku-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"shang-pivot\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99 {{uri}}"
        }
      ]
    },
